Dear Farzan,

This happens because R and Python disagree on the location of your home folder. We will try to get a proper fix in place soon but in the meantime please try the workaround described here:

https://github.com/seung-lab/cloud-volume/issues/534#issuecomment-1090867857

Editing the paths to account for your username. Best,
Greg.

